{"corpus":"ccc","number":906,"text_html":"<span>Ceux d’entre les fidèles laïcs qui en sont capables et qui s’y forment peuvent aussi prêter leur concours à la formation catéchétique <sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"a\">a</sup><sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"b\">b</sup><sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"c\">c</sup>, à l’enseignement des sciences sacrées <sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"d\">d</sup>, aux moyens de communication sociale<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§2495</sup> <sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"e\">e</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":["2495"],"bible_refs":[],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"canon_law","raw":"voir ⇒ CIC, can. 774","idx":"a","doc_raw":"⇒ CIC, can. 774"},{"type":"canon_law","raw":"⇒ 776","idx":"b","doc_raw":"⇒ 776"},{"type":"canon_law","raw":"⇒ 780","idx":"c","doc_raw":"⇒ 780"},{"type":"canon_law","raw":"voir ⇒ CIC, can. 229","idx":"d","doc_raw":"⇒ CIC, can. 229"},{"type":"canon_law","raw":"voir ⇒ CIC, can. 823, § 1","idx":"e","doc_raw":"⇒ CIC, can. 823, § 1"}]}